### 1. 회원 등록
POST http://localhost/member/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user1",
  "pw": "pass1",
  "name": "usr1",
  "phone": "010-1111-1111"
}

### 2. 회원 목록
GET http://localhost/member/list

### 3. 회원 상세보기
GET http://localhost/member/get/admin

### 4. 회원 수정
PUT http://localhost/member/update/user1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "u1",
  "phone": "010-0000-0001"
}

### 5. 회원 삭제
DELETE localhost/member/delete/user1